---
description: Point the agent at durable repository conventions before proposing an architectural decision
alwaysApply: true
---

Before proposing where a change belongs in this repository, read `AGENTS.md`
at the repository root. It records conventions this codebase has already
settled (for example, where different classes of validation belong) so that
work does not re-derive them from scratch. If a task discovers a new durable
convention, add it to `AGENTS.md` rather than only stating it in chat.
